    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "common_2020_esper_010_select_02",
      "hash64": "5D4C73E974ED2C57",
      "text": "莉普妳也是",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "common_2020_esper_010_esper_03a",
      "hash64": "FE4BCEAA032E697C",
      "text": "嗯呵！率真的孩子最棒了。\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳要一直保持這樣子喲。[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
