    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "common_2020_esper_010_esper_05",
      "hash64": "49A59B62ABD9D0C3",
      "text": "老實說我對那個人不是很拿手。\\n她那美艷的氣場，又會和我撞人設……[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "common_2020_esper_010_esper_06",
      "hash64": "49A59C62ABD9D276",
      "text": "所以由[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳代替她，\\n說不定反而比較好呢。[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
