      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "common_2020_esper_010_esper_08",
      "hash64": "49A5A662ABD9E374",
      "text": "那麼，[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳現在就要和莉普我\\n追求究極之美了嗎？[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
