    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "common_2020_esper_010_esper_retry",
      "hash64": "29C355AC84C94806",
      "text": "辛苦嘍，[VAR 0x0100(0000)]，\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳要和莉普我追求究極之美了嗎？[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
