      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "common_2020_esper_010_esper_10",
      "hash64": "49A8A462ABDC15E5",
      "text": "莉普我很忙的。\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳要快快回來喲。[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
